      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, I addressed your concerns by changing the syntax to \"users\u003dhuman_reviewers\". Then it doesn\u0027t conflict with any of what you have described here, if anyone wants to implement this at a later point in time. My constraint for this change is that I have like max 1 more day that I can invest into this. So I have no time to implement any support for a +\u003d/-\u003d syntax.\n\nI don\u0027t think \"permitted_reviewers\" reviewers is a good idea, as this would require checking permissions from a post filter predicate, and at least for us we know that checking permissions for all reviewers when generating change details has poor performance.",
