      "writtenOn": "2024-10-17T02:27:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve actually been meaning to look at this restriction because I do have a use case for it. This team wants to require a +2 Code-Review vote from users in a certain group for a specific submit requirement, but they don\u0027t want to count +2 votes from the uploader. So they need something like `submittableIf \u003d label:Code-Review\u003d2,user\u003dnon_uploader,group\u003dldap/special.reviewers`. In this case the semantics would be the same as with other args where we do a boolean `AND`, so we require both the `user\u003d` and `group\u003d` args to match.",
      "revId": "509bf117939193a23c43889bb27e225aa9732f99",
